# Paths excluded from config-sync (one per line, relative to repo root).
# Blank lines and '#' comments are allowed.
#
# renovate.json5 carries repo-specific packageRules (e.g. pinning
# Microsoft.ApplicationInsights.WorkerService < 3.0.0), so we manage it locally
# instead of letting config-sync overwrite it with the central template.
renovate.json5

# APM (from DevSecNinja/ai-toolkit) deploys and updates these instruction
# files. This repo pins an older config-sync that syncs from DevSecNinja/.github
# main without an APM-aware skip, so keep it from overwriting them.
# See https://github.com/DevSecNinja/repo-steward/issues/36
.github/instructions/devsecninja-conventions.instructions.md
.github/instructions/untrusted-repositories.instructions.md
.github/instructions/writing-style.instructions.md
